---
source: crates/engage/tests/integrations/main.rs
description: Should successfully print the short help and exit.
---
A process composer with ordering and parallelism based on directed acyclic graphs.

Usage: engage [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  just         Run a specific process
  dot          Output Graphviz' `dot` representation of the DAG and exit
  list         Print a list of the available processes
  completions  Print completions for a given shell
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -f, --file <FILE>              Manually choose the Engage file
  -l, --log-format <LOG_FORMAT>  Log format [default: default] [possible values: default, compact, full, pretty, json]
  -h, --help                     Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version                  Print version
